,null,null,9.3],"summary":"Saylor策略公司于2026年11月15日增持485枚比特币（价值约3340万美元）并回购2.28亿美元股票，总比特币持仓增至850,849枚，以对冲市场暴跌和MSCI规则调整风险【新】\n\n公司自2020年起持续增持比特币，当前持仓规模为市场第四大。根据MSCI规则调整，成分股市值占比低于15%或营收占比低于10%的企业需从相关指数剔除，Saylor因比特币持仓占比过高面临潜在风险【新】【旧】\n\n具体操作中，公司通过出售股票获得24.47亿美元资金，其中2.06亿美元用于回购优先股，3340万美元用于购入比特币（均价75,452美元/枚含手续费），剩余500万美元留存现金。比特币持仓均价为75,452美元/枚，较增持前下跌42%（同期股价下跌28%）【新】","latest":"Strategy公司以3340万美元购入485枚比特币，总持仓增至850,849枚","cover":null},{"rank":2,"story":{"publicId":"2fd808a3-75fa-4cfe-a37b-57fa5a7510d4","title":"美国CFTC发布AI芯片远程访问限制规定引主体争议及市场波动"},"heat":33.1,"trend":"up","trendPct":13.7,"badges":[],"participantCount":4,"sourceCount":4,"sourceNames":["MarketWatch Top Stories","The Defiant","PANews","链捕手 ChainCatcher"],"participants":[{"iconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/f6c9f78e45078dd1e9c20a05729886768a9dc1479ed49c96feeeb59890323758.webp","iconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/2f28b8d2924d2e1af02f9354c19807c5a62d2c1c5baead9a4b34ed24c2491fb7.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/f6c9f78e45078dd1e9c20a05729886768a9dc1479ed49c96feeeb59890323758.webp 96w","name":"PANews","kind":"editorial"},{"iconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/05ff8f4aae1945ba9bb7300c7fa2755b1e21c0aba3ddfc70cd9bc11db3101fe6.webp","iconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/79a5eb1742a839a34e8eba3975a15b3e2c76c9a88080b44a4f7703dd2968e315.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/05ff8f4aae1945ba9bb7300c7fa2755b1e21c0aba3ddfc70cd9bc11db3101fe6.webp 96w","name":"链捕手 ChainCatcher","kind":"editorial"},{"iconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/21583c6886c21bce1927f3d59a85dcf7d3c978aafe60278efd303d2c0fa89607.webp","iconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/225c8aa97260f72481bf08fcda803749fcb72936e521407b941da6d427a4e11e.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/21583c6886c21bce1927f3d59a85dcf7d3c978aafe60278efd303d2c0fa89607.webp 96w","name":"The Defiant","kind":"editorial"},{"iconUrl":null,"name":"MarketWatch Top Stories","kind":"editorial"}],"spark":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,8.5,17],"summary":"美国商品交易委员会（CFTC）发布要求AI芯片远程访问必须通过本地代理完成的规定，并设定了合规时间表与审计要求，导致英伟达股价因限制中国访问先进芯片持续下跌。主体争议源于早期报道误将发布机构标注为商务部（Department of Commerce），后续事实条件更正为CFTC，可能与机构职责混淆有关。该规定直接影响跨国AI芯片企业布局，但具体执行细节尚未披露，且存在主体描述矛盾可能引发监管执行不确定性。\n\nCFTC规定要求访问AI芯片需通过本地代理完成，并设定了2026年12月31日前完成合规的时间表，但未明确技术标准或地域限制。英伟达股价自新规宣布后持续下跌，因规则限制中国访问先进AI芯片，影响其海外市场预期。\n\n存在新旧报道主体矛盾：2026-11-16 21:27链捕手报道显示CFTC为发布主体，但标题和内容均标注为商务部；后续22:02的The Defiant报道明确商务部为发布主体，但事实条件字段显示CFTC，可能存在数据源冲突。","latest":"英伟达股价因美国政府新规限制中国访问先进芯片而持续下跌","cover":null},{"rank":3,"story":{"publicId":"61cd726d-7683-4b09-8b81-6be15890622d","title":"Lighter交易所API密钥泄露致超1.5亿美元资金外流，Abraxas Capital关联平仓"},"heat":31.9,"trend":"down","trendPct":-16.1,"badges":[],"participantCount":4,"sourceCount":4,"sourceNames":["Unchained","链捕手 ChainCatcher","PANews","The Defiant"],"participants":[{"iconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/05ff8f4aae1945ba9bb7300c7fa2755b1e21c0aba3ddfc70cd9bc11db3101fe6.webp","iconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/79a5eb1742a839a34e8eba3975a15b3e2c76c9a88080b44a4f7703dd2968e315.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/05ff8f4aae1945ba9bb7300c7fa2755b1e21c0aba3ddfc70cd9bc11db3101fe6.webp 96w","name":"链捕手 ChainCatcher","kind":"editorial"},{"iconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/f6c9f78e45078dd1e9c20a05729886768a9dc1479ed49c96feeeb59890323758.webp","iconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/2f28b8d2924d2e1af02f9354c19807c5a62d2c1c5baead9a4b34ed24c2491fb7.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/f6c9f78e45078dd1e9c20a05729886768a9dc1479ed49c96feeeb59890323758.webp 96w","name":"PANews","kind":"editorial"},{"iconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/fa45a4b0d924ec2c790ec5c529735ada5876ee1d2094a91834e0ce1ca7df006d.webp","iconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/1b4d6e1a262b9aeb3b737456d54ad7154cc6e47aea321b5cd3f31dea6c37fa6f.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/fa45a4b0d924ec2c790ec5c529735ada5876ee1d2094a91834e0ce1ca7df006d.webp 96w","name":"Unchained","kind":"editorial"},{"iconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/21583c6886c21bce1927f3d59a85dcf7d3c978aafe60278efd303d2c0fa89607.webp","iconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/225c8aa97260f72481bf08fcda803749fcb72936e521407b941da6d427a4e11e.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/21583c6886c21bce1927f3d59a85dcf7d3c978aafe60278efd303d2c0fa89607.webp 96w","name":"The Defiant","kind":"editorial"}],"spark":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,8,32.5],"summary":"Lighter交易所因API密钥泄露导致超1500万美元资金外流，暂停提现及资金池创建，并确认与Abraxas Capital关联的单一外部方入侵事件。攻击者于UTC 10:11:47通过智能合约提现10390000 USDC，经CoW Swap兑换5760 ETH后转移至Hyperliquid平台，触发该做市商平仓并撤资约1.5亿美元（ChainCatcher/PANews）。Abraxas Capital相关地址24小时内账户价值减少1.5亿美元，空头仓位缩至约7000万美元（Unchained/ChainCatcher）。Lighter团队表示正在调查是否需升级智能合约，但未披露具体损失金额及用户数据影响范围。","latest":"Lighter交易所因API密钥泄露致超1500万美元资金外流","cover":null},{"rank":4,"story":{"publicId":"e04530de-0889-41a0-8ed8-6e00c5389ac0","title":"Jupiter推出Bullish股票代币化借贷市场及全球身份认证服务"},"heat":27.5,"trend":"new","trendPct":null,"badges":["surge","new"],"participantCount":3,"sourceCount":3,"sourceNames":["Crypto Briefing","链捕手 ChainCatcher","Decrypt"],"participants":[{"iconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/05ff8f4aae1945ba9bb7300c7fa2755b1e21c0aba3ddfc70cd9bc11db3101fe6.webp","iconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/79a5eb1742a839a34e8eba3975a15b3e2c76c9a88080b44a4f7703dd2968e315.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/05ff8f4aae1945ba9bb7300c7fa2755b1e21c0aba3ddfc70cd9bc11db3101fe6.webp 96w","name":"链捕手 ChainCatcher","kind":"editorial"},{"iconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/c25a33f3f3500a495dc69cede8cf4fc350b907af79fc24007e68e0819db0747e.webp","iconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/a192c125ac7c90e5e5369c2f6b25b235e5783c7c265d2b663f70de4fcda2fd35.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/c25a33f3f3500a495dc69cede8cf4fc350b907af79fc24007e68e0819db0747e.webp 96w","name":"Decrypt","kind":"editorial"},{"iconUrl":null,"name":"Crypto Briefing","kind":"editorial"}],"spark":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,9.8,19,28.1],"summary":"Jupiter于2026年11月17日推出链上许可制借贷市场，首批支持以纽约证券交易所上市公司Bullish（BLSH）的代币化股票作为抵押品，用户无需出售股票即可获得流动性，目前仅限部分司法辖区开放（Decrypt报道）。该市场计划于2027年1月1日关闭（早先报道），但后续补充显示其与Bullish合作开发受限市场，并计划通过单次集成接入更多发行方代币及服务（Crypto Briefing报道）。Bullish代币由发行方直接设计为‘本身即股票’，区别于仅赋予股票索取权的其他代币，市场支持全链上清算并与合格托管机构合作（ChainCatcher报道）。Jupiter同期发布Global Passport身份验证服务，帮助发行方将代币引入链上交易，目前该服务已开放（新报道）。","latest":"Jupiter推出全球身份认证及流动性服务，目标直指闲置代币资产","cover":null},{"rank":5,"story":{"publicId":"e22a707a-4c11-479c-86f5-e98f4548114c","title":"Anthropic拟IPO估值上调至1.5万亿引财务风险担忧"},"heat":26.5,"trend":"new","trendPct":null,"badges":["surge"],"participantCount":3,"sourceCount":3,"sourceNames":["Seeking Alpha","界面新闻","华尔街见闻"],"participants":[{"iconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp","iconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/346b778cce9e0a65daba16f325d5fbe07959b87561ecaa9068f64b2c9592cdd6.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp 96w","name":"华尔街见闻","kind":"editorial"},{"iconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/8a38891190fe9c5746056cd9f910f6507b39931cc68aff10b5b7ba3ca1be11b3.webp","iconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/3fa9d436c8291250715c22ef31328d4840f6e992f49d24ec46545d05558308cb.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/8a38891190fe9c5746056cd9f910f6507b39931cc68aff10b5b7ba3ca1be11b3.webp 96w","name":"Seeking Alpha","kind":"editorial"},{"iconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/c805ddc63768b4f0fa179b6390f69b3d1685a403018bf6443a0365d5673b4862.webp","iconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/37d4e70beec4574e9b457f547ecba779ae6a3ec96ca2f9d4a852ac50e9715247.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/c805ddc63768b4f0fa179b6390f69b3d1685a403018bf6443a0365d5673b4862.webp 96w","name":"界面新闻","kind":"editorial"}],"spark":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,27],"summary":"高盛、摩根士丹利作为承销商，因数倍超额认购考虑将Anthropic IPO估值从1.4万亿美元上调至1.5万亿以上，但公司Q3毛利率仅15%（同比降4个百分点）、净亏损1040亿美元，且需在2045年前投入8954亿美元建设数据中心。市场质疑高估值与持续亏损及OpenAI等竞争对手的挤压效应匹配性。Anthropic计划发行8.25亿股（新发801.4百万股+老股东2365万股），定价区间70-78美元/股，目标融资904亿美元（IPO 64.4亿+私募260亿），获Alphabet、NVIDIA等七家科技巨头私募投资支持。部分机构通过JonesTrading溢价转售场外股份（溢价3%-5%），七位联合创始人拟套现17.5亿美元（人均约2.5亿）。招股书显示长期调整后运营毛利率目标超35%，但Q3实际毛利率同比降4个百分点，计算资源成本占营收比例达55%（上半年支出89.45亿美元）。","latest":"Anthropic IPO定价在即，或成Renaissance IPO ETF关键催化剂","cover":null},{"rank":6,"story":{"publicId":"f51ba7d9-1519-4f82-962f-5e0236681085","title":"Coinbase与Broadridge推出链上股东通信标准框架，投票功能暂缓"},"heat":25.7,"trend":"up","trendPct":35.3,"badges":["rising"],"participantCount":3,"sourceCount":3,"sourceNames":["Cointelegraph","The Defiant","PANews"],"participants":[{"iconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/f6c9f78e45078dd1e9c20a05729886768a9dc1479ed49c96feeeb59890323758.webp","iconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/2f28b8d2924d2e1af02f9354c19807c5a62d2c1c5baead9a4b34ed24c2491fb7.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/f6c9f78e45078dd1e9c20a05729886768a9dc1479ed49c96feeeb59890323758.webp 96w","name":"PANews","kind":"editorial"},{"iconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/37ea346353e612445d84b46266c2d66f6c1804dcbe725a99a35373e78ce4a3bf.webp","iconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/e305f14ac3c89a8eea5964e7526b7ce6185e048a2b6a69dc244016bd8d40f48b.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/37ea346353e612445d84b46266c2d66f6c1804dcbe725a99a35373e78ce4a3bf.webp 96w","name":"Cointelegraph","kind":"editorial"},{"iconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/21583c6886c21bce1927f3d59a85dcf7d3c978aafe60278efd303d2c0fa89607.webp","iconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/225c8aa97260f72481bf08fcda803749fcb72936e521407b941da6d427a4e11e.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/21583c6886c21bce1927f3d59a85dcf7d3c978aafe60278efd303d2c0fa89607.webp 96w","name":"The Defiant","kind":"editorial"}],"spark":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,16.2],"summary":"Coinbase与Broadridge于2026年11月16日联合提出链上股东通信标准框架，初步实现代币化股票与公司公告的Base和以太坊链同步，但投票功能未包含在内【新】。该框架通过以太坊改进提案（EIP）提交，Broadridge同步推出兼容该标准的Oracle服务，可统一格式展示分红日期等通知，但提案明确不赋予股东实际权利，仅建立技术沟通框架【新】。此前报道指出投票功能未落地且数据字段定义待确认【旧】。","latest":"Coinbase与Broadridge合作提出代币化股票信息披露标准","cover":null},{"rank":7,"story":{"publicId":"defc56ff-43d9-4744-936c-26078a52b9d0","title":"ICE纽约证券交易所ATS系统完成Solana代币适配并考虑加入验证者网络"},"heat":24.5,"trend":"down","trendPct":-16.1,"badges":[],"participantCount":3,"sourceCount":3,"sourceNames":["The Defiant","PANews","链捕手 ChainCatcher"],"participants":[{"iconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/f6c9f78e45078dd1e9c20a05729886768a9dc1479ed49c96feeeb59890323758.webp","iconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/2f28b8d2924d2e1af02f9354c19807c5a62d2c1c5baead9a4b34ed24c2491fb7.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/f6c9f78e45078dd1e9c20a05729886768a9dc1479ed49c96feeeb59890323758.webp 96w","name":"PANews","kind":"editorial"},{"iconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/05ff8f4aae1945ba9bb7300c7fa2755b1e21c0aba3ddfc70cd9bc11db3101fe6.webp","iconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/79a5eb1742a839a34e8eba3975a15b3e2c76c9a88080b44a4f7703dd2968e315.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/05ff8f4aae1945ba9bb7300c7fa2755b1e21c0aba3ddfc70cd9bc11db3101fe6.webp 96w","name":"链捕手 ChainCatcher","kind":"editorial"},{"iconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/21583c6886c21bce1927f3d59a85dcf7d3c978aafe60278efd303d2c0fa89607.webp","iconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/225c8aa97260f72481bf08fcda803749fcb72936e521407b941da6d427a4e11e.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/21583c6886c21bce1927f3d59a85dcf7d3c978aafe60278efd303d2c0fa89607.webp 96w","name":"The Defiant","kind":"editorial"}],"spark":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],"summary":"ICE（纽约证券交易所母公司）宣布其ATS系统已完成技术适配，可接收Solana链上铸造的代币，并正在评估加入Solana验证者网络的可行性。这一进展由ICE Clear Europe总裁Hester Serafini于2026年11月16日通过三篇报道同步披露【新】【新】【新】。ICE同时提及Avalanche的结算角色规划，但未明确与Solana验证者网络的竞争或协同关系。","latest":"ICE（纽约证券交易所母公司）考虑加入Solana验证者网络","cover":null},{"rank":8,"story":{"publicId":"7a201069-c5a3-49d9-a382-5a1257282629","title":"Solana退役测试版并发布1.0共享协议版本"},"heat":24.3,"trend":"up","trendPct":31.4,"badges":["rising"],"participantCount":3,"sourceCount":3,"sourceNames":["Decrypt","The Block","The Defiant"],"participants":[{"iconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/03ab07c950800a2f0f7d53b864faeb17d5b0902b04887c3fe43b9eb83178915c.webp","iconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/d3547b0702d576d9fb6ec4be5c6417de1dabfad729dbabaa59823134a3d71581.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/03ab07c950800a2f0f7d53b864faeb17d5b0902b04887c3fe43b9eb83178915c.webp 96w","name":"The Block","kind":"editorial"},{"iconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/c25a33f3f3500a495dc69cede8cf4fc350b907af79fc24007e68e0819db0747e.webp","iconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/a192c125ac7c90e5e5369c2f6b25b235e5783c7c265d2b663f70de4fcda2fd35.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/c25a33f3f3500a495dc69cede8cf4fc350b907af79fc24007e68e0819db0747e.webp 96w","name":"Decrypt","kind":"editorial"},{"iconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/21583c6886c21bce1927f3d59a85dcf7d3c978aafe60278efd303d2c0fa89607.webp","iconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/225c8aa97260f72481bf08fcda803749fcb72936e521407b941da6d427a4e11e.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/21583c6886c21bce1927f3d59a85dcf7d3c978aafe60278efd303d2c0fa89607.webp 96w","name":"The Defiant","kind":"editorial"}],"spark":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,9.5,17.5,null],"summary":"Solana基金会退役主网测试版并推出1.0共享协议版本，未引入新功能或影响用户资产。测试版自2019年上线后持续迭代，1.0版本通过标准化接口提升生态协作效率，同时保留不同软件版本支持相同网络功能的灵活性。\n\n